{"4227030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ABISMO", "steam_appid": 4227030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4807300], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/477d661aedda5ca81099fc0182cc808d.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/477d661aedda5ca81099fc0182cc808d.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/477d661aedda5ca81099fc0182cc808d.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seafloor changes every dive. Explore unstable caverns, derelict facilities, and bioluminescent ecosystems filled with predators, contamination hazards, collapsing structures, and failing equipment. Manage oxygen, light, sonar, and suit integrity, because the deeper you go, the fewer second chances you’ll get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/36e4073c31915bc803634a7e363ff3a8.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/36e4073c31915bc803634a7e363ff3a8.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/36e4073c31915bc803634a7e363ff3a8.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/eb75f7b64f7d33f5bbb91e32c7e76437.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/eb75f7b64f7d33f5bbb91e32c7e76437.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/eb75f7b64f7d33f5bbb91e32c7e76437.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a crash landing, your only way out is to rebuild your ship. Its scattered components lie deep within dangerous facilities and lost zones across the ocean floor. Push further, take greater risks, and decide how much you’re willing to lose to make it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/b3f8c6c06248fda35e9fb8258d793ccf.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/b3f8c6c06248fda35e9fb8258d793ccf.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/b3f8c6c06248fda35e9fb8258d793ccf.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/ddf4242125faa8c94f0df7744e1c26a7.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/ddf4242125faa8c94f0df7744e1c26a7.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/ddf4242125faa8c94f0df7744e1c26a7.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a fragmented, optional narrative through corrupted VHS logs, distorted audio, and decaying terminals. Follow the signal and piece together what happened here or ignore it, and focus on survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/016ca15bfb373a772dbf9528daace2e9.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/016ca15bfb373a772dbf9528daace2e9.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/016ca15bfb373a772dbf9528daace2e9.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/1124e6c4deec59b43cb8ee7614e9467a.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/1124e6c4deec59b43cb8ee7614e9467a.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/1124e6c4deec59b43cb8ee7614e9467a.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in co-op with up to 4 players. Coordinate, communicate, and survive together using proximity voice chat—where distance, interference, and panic can turn even simple plans into chaos. Every dive creates new, unpredictable situations driven by player interaction and the hostile world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/d30ee1ee60317256256923431bf7f9a5.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/d30ee1ee60317256256923431bf7f9a5.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/d30ee1ee60317256256923431bf7f9a5.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/477d661aedda5ca81099fc0182cc808d.poster.avif?t=1785236865\" width=800 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/477d661aedda5ca81099fc0182cc808d.webm?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227030/extras/477d661aedda5ca81099fc0182cc808d.mp4?t=1785236865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seafloor changes every dive. Explore unstable caverns, derelict facilities, and bioluminescent ecosystems filled with predators, contamination hazards, collapsing structures, and failing equipment. Manage oxygen, light, sonar, and suit integrity, because the deeper you go, the fewer s